# Jekyll posts

Filename: `_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.html`. Always `layout: post` (wraps `_layouts/post.html` → `default`).

Required front matter (clone a recent post, e.g. `_posts/2025-03-24-*.html`):

```yaml
layout: post
date: YYYY-MM-DD
author: Gervis Bermudez
title: "..."
description: ...
thumbnail: /public/uploads/YYYY/MM/...
banner: /public/uploads/YYYY/MM/...
contact_banner: /public/uploads/YYYY/MM/...
category: Web Development
tags: ["Tag"]
```

Do not invent image paths. Placeholders go in `public/uploads/YYYY/MM/` matching `date`. Pipe body images with `| relative_url`.

`_layouts/post.html` already `{% include contact-banner.html %}`. Do not paste that block into the post body. Set `contact_banner` in front matter only.

Permalink comes from `_config.yml`: `/blog/:categories/:year/:month/:day/:title`. Prod URL is that path under `baseurl` `/site`. Do not hardcode `/site` in the post.
